      <h2>About Zanzibar Horse Riding (Nungwi)</h2>
      <p>Zanzibar Horse Club in Nungwi offers the unique experience of swimming with horses in the warm Indian Ocean — a bucket-list activity where horses and riders enter the water together at high tide, horses swimming alongside riders in crystal-clear turquoise water. Beach riding along Nungwi&#x27;s pristine white sand at sunset is also available. Suitable for all riding levels; horses are well-trained and guides ensure safety. High-tide sessions for swimming; sunset beach rides daily. A truly unforgettable Zanzibar experience.</p>

